{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Gemini 显式上下文缓存（cachedContents）",
    "description": "把反复使用的长前缀（长文档、系统指令、工具定义）一次创建成缓存，后续生成请求只带缓存名和新问题；缓存部分按「缓存命中」单价计费。接口格式与 Gemini 原生 cachedContents 接口一致。",
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT"
    },
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://direct.evolink.ai",
      "description": "生产环境（推荐）"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://api.evolink.ai",
      "description": "备用地址"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "bearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "显式上下文缓存",
      "description": "创建、查询、延长、删除 Gemini 显式缓存"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1beta/cachedContents": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "创建缓存",
        "operationId": "geminiCreateCachedContent",
        "tags": [
          "显式上下文缓存"
        ],
        "description": "把 `contents`、`systemInstruction`、`tools`（至少一项，可另带 `toolConfig`）创建为一份缓存，返回缓存名 `name`。\n\n- **模型**：`model` 写 `models/gemini-3.8-flash` 或 `gemini-3.8-flash` 都可以。支持 `gemini-3.8-flash`、`gemini-3.7-flash`、`gemini-3.6-flash`、`gemini-3.5-flash`、`gemini-3.5-flash-lite`、`gemini-3-flash-preview`、`gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview`、`gemini-3.1-pro-preview`、`gemini-3.1-pro-preview-customtools`、`gemini-3-pro-preview`；Gemini 4 系列不支持显式缓存。\n- **有效期**：`ttl` 形如 `\"3600s\"`，或 `expireTime`（RFC 3339 时间），两者只能给一个；都不填默认 1 小时。最短 60 秒，最长 168 小时（`604800s`），到期自动删除。\n- **大小**：请求体不超过 10 MB；缓存内容需达到模型要求的最小 token 数（如 `gemini-3.8-flash` 为 4,096 token），不足返回 400。\n- **字段**：只接受本接口列出的字段，传入其它字段返回 400。\n- **tools**：只接受 `googleSearch`、`codeExecution`、`functionDeclarations`，其它工具返回 400。\n- **返回的 `name`**：形如 `cachedContents/<id>`，`<id>` 就是本次请求的请求 ID。在控制台「日志」页按这个 id 搜索，就能看到创建缓存的扣费记录。\n- **计费**：创建时收取「缓存写入费」（单价与输入相同），并按有效期一次收取「缓存存储费」（每百万 token 每小时）；引用缓存时，命中部分按缓存命中单价计费，缓存中声明了 `googleSearch` 时每次搜索另计。缩短、删除、到期都不退存储费；延长按新增时长补收。各模型单价见 [价格页](https://evolink.ai/pricing)。\n\n认证使用 `Authorization: Bearer`，也接受 `x-goog-api-key` 请求头。",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateCachedContentRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "long_document": {
                  "summary": "缓存一份长文档 + 系统指令，有效期 1 小时",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "models/gemini-3.8-flash",
                    "displayName": "product-manual-v3",
                    "systemInstruction": {
                      "parts": [
                        {
                          "text": "你是产品手册助手，只依据给定的手册内容回答，手册里没有的信息回答“手册未提及”。"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "contents": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "parts": [
                          {
                            "text": "（这里放产品手册全文。缓存内容需不少于 4,096 token。）"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ],
                    "ttl": "3600s"
                  }
                },
                "with_tools": {
                  "summary": "缓存系统指令 + 函数定义，用绝对到期时间",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "gemini-3.8-flash",
                    "displayName": "support-agent-tools",
                    "systemInstruction": {
                      "parts": [
                        {
                          "text": "（这里放很长的客服规范，需不少于 4,096 token。）"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "contents": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "parts": [
                          {
                            "text": "（历史工单样例……）"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ],
                    "tools": [
                      {
                        "functionDeclarations": [
                          {
                            "name": "lookup_order",
                            "description": "按订单号查询订单状态",
                            "parameters": {
                              "type": "object",
                              "properties": {
                                "order_id": {
                                  "type": "string"
                                }
                              },
                              "required": [
                                "order_id"
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ],
                    "expireTime": "2026-11-03T06:00:00Z"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "缓存已创建。`usageMetadata.totalTokenCount` 是缓存的 token 数，写入费与存储费都按它计算",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CachedContent"
                },
                "example": {
                  "name": "cachedContents/20261103012026348092000s1oTuB96",
                  "model": "models/gemini-3.8-flash",
                  "displayName": "product-manual-v3",
                  "createTime": "2026-11-03T01:20:27.311Z",
                  "updateTime": "2026-11-03T01:20:27.311Z",
                  "expireTime": "2026-11-03T02:20:26.902Z",
                  "usageMetadata": {
                    "totalTokenCount": 7525
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "参数错误；模型不支持显式缓存；当前用户组暂未开放；缓存内容不足最小 token 数",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 400,
                    "message": "ttl must not exceed 604800s (168h)",
                    "status": "INVALID_ARGUMENT",
                    "details": [
                      {
                        "@type": "type.googleapis.com/google.rpc.ErrorInfo",
                        "reason": "INVALID_ARGUMENT",
                        "domain": "evolink.ai"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "API Key 无效或缺失",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 401,
                    "message": "Invalid API key",
                    "status": "UNAUTHENTICATED"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "402": {
            "description": "余额不足以支付缓存写入费和存储费",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 402,
                    "message": "insufficient quota for cache storage prepayment",
                    "status": "RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED",
                    "details": [
                      {
                        "@type": "type.googleapis.com/google.rpc.ErrorInfo",
                        "reason": "INSUFFICIENT_QUOTA",
                        "domain": "evolink.ai"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Key 无权使用该模型、来源 IP 不在 Key 的白名单内，或 Key 所在的用户组已不可用",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 403,
                    "message": "This key is not allowed to use model gemini-3.8-flash",
                    "status": "PERMISSION_DENIED"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "显式缓存功能未开放",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 404,
                    "message": "explicit context caching is not enabled",
                    "status": "NOT_FOUND",
                    "details": [
                      {
                        "@type": "type.googleapis.com/google.rpc.ErrorInfo",
                        "reason": "EXPLICIT_CACHE_DISABLED",
                        "domain": "evolink.ai"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "413": {
            "description": "请求体超过 10 MB",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 413,
                    "message": "cache content exceeds 10485760 bytes; reference large files with fileData.fileUri instead",
                    "status": "INVALID_ARGUMENT",
                    "details": [
                      {
                        "@type": "type.googleapis.com/google.rpc.ErrorInfo",
                        "reason": "CACHE_CONTENT_TOO_LARGE",
                        "domain": "evolink.ai"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "触发频率限制",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 429,
                    "message": "Rate limit exceeded",
                    "status": "RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "服务暂时不可用，本次不扣费，请稍后重试",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 502,
                    "message": "the request could not be completed due to a service authorization problem; please retry later or contact support",
                    "status": "INTERNAL",
                    "details": [
                      {
                        "@type": "type.googleapis.com/google.rpc.ErrorInfo",
                        "reason": "UPSTREAM_ERROR",
                        "domain": "evolink.ai"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "服务暂时不可用，请稍后重试",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 503,
                    "message": "explicit context caching is temporarily unavailable",
                    "status": "UNAVAILABLE",
                    "details": [
                      {
                        "@type": "type.googleapis.com/google.rpc.ErrorInfo",
                        "reason": "INTERNAL",
                        "domain": "evolink.ai"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "get": {
        "summary": "查询缓存列表",
        "operationId": "geminiListCachedContents",
        "tags": [
          "显式上下文缓存"
        ],
        "description": "列出当前账号下所有**未过期**的缓存（按账号归属，不区分 Key），按到期时间倒序排列。已过期、已删除的不在列表里。免费。",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "pageSize",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "每页条数，默认 50，最大 200。",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "default": 50,
              "maximum": 200
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "pageToken",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "上一页响应里的 `nextPageToken`；第一页不填。",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "缓存列表。还有下一页时带 `nextPageToken`",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ListCachedContentsResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "cachedContents": [
                    {
                      "name": "cachedContents/20261103012026348092000s1oTuB96",
                      "model": "models/gemini-3.8-flash",
                      "displayName": "product-manual-v3",
                      "createTime": "2026-11-03T01:20:27.311Z",
                      "updateTime": "2026-11-03T01:20:27.311Z",
                      "expireTime": "2026-11-03T02:20:26.902Z",
                      "usageMetadata": {
                        "totalTokenCount": 7525
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "nextPageToken": "50"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "pageToken 不合法",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 400,
                    "message": "invalid pageToken",
                    "status": "INVALID_ARGUMENT",
                    "details": [
                      {
                        "@type": "type.googleapis.com/google.rpc.ErrorInfo",
                        "reason": "INVALID_ARGUMENT",
                        "domain": "evolink.ai"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "API Key 无效或缺失",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 401,
                    "message": "Invalid API key",
                    "status": "UNAUTHENTICATED"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Key 无权使用该模型，或来源 IP 不在 Key 的白名单内",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 403,
                    "message": "This key is not allowed to use model gemini-3.8-flash",
                    "status": "PERMISSION_DENIED"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "显式缓存功能未开放",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 404,
                    "message": "explicit context caching is not enabled",
                    "status": "NOT_FOUND",
                    "details": [
                      {
                        "@type": "type.googleapis.com/google.rpc.ErrorInfo",
                        "reason": "EXPLICIT_CACHE_DISABLED",
                        "domain": "evolink.ai"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "触发频率限制",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 429,
                    "message": "Rate limit exceeded",
                    "status": "RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "服务暂时不可用，请稍后重试",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 503,
                    "message": "explicit context caching is temporarily unavailable",
                    "status": "UNAVAILABLE",
                    "details": [
                      {
                        "@type": "type.googleapis.com/google.rpc.ErrorInfo",
                        "reason": "INTERNAL",
                        "domain": "evolink.ai"
                      }
